# OS / editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data — source/reference datasets and evidence snapshots are too large or
# externally sourced for normal repository commits. The small pathway lookup
# files remain available to support an offline clone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/sequence_defined_inputs/
/evaluation/data/
/data/processed/*.parquet
/data/processed/*.csv
/data/processed/*.csv.gz
!/data/processed/pathways/
!/data/processed/pathways/*.csv.gz
!/data/processed/pathways/*.csv
!/data/processed/pathways/*.parquet
/mirassist_evidence_pairs_test.csv

# The active RF-v1 table is a local validation copy. The canonical table for
# the model is uploaded as a GitHub Release asset (see docs/production_variant_a_rf_v1.md).
/data/processed/mirassist_evidence_variant_a_rf_v1.parquet
/data/processed/mirassist_evidence_pairs.parquet
/data/processed/mirassist_evidence_pairs.csv.gz

